  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "While searching the regional wall for a weak spot into Northern Plains, he laughs aloud that after nearly a thousand areas they have finally found an ideal passage. At the end of a dissolving wall passage he stands and activates an Immortal Gu that opens a sixty-seven steps path deeper in. As immortal aperture losses mount he hopes the trip can subdue one or two Immortal Gu, or the losses will be too huge.",
      "chapters": [
        710
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_northern_plains",
        "sys_immortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "At the Tai Qiu aftermath he belongs to Black Heaven Temple, one of the ten great ancient sects. When Fairy Ling Mei suggests the enemy may already have found their long concealment and that they should go to Jade Pool blessed land, he retorts that Black Heaven Temple’s signature immortal killer move defending day and night should not be treated as easily seen through.",
      "chapters": [
        811
